# Throwaway visual-check harnesses (verify-docks.html etc). Render a real area
# through the real renderer settings so a change can be looked at, not just
# tested. Kept out of the repo because they are scratch, but kept ON DISK
# because the visual pass has caught defects the suite structurally cannot.
verify-*.html
# These four import src/render/rig.js, so they are kept in the repo where a rig change cannot leave them behind. The other verify pages stay scratch.
!verify-park.html
!verify-docks.html
!verify-seaside.html
!verify-neighborhood.html
# These three import the stage/controller/rig too: the dressing room's sign-off record and the source of the place pictures.
!verify-dressingroom-mockup.html
!verify-dressingroom.html
!verify-places.html
# This one drives the real home base (and its hero stage) through every visit celebration and prize: the visit milestones' sign-off record.
!verify-visits.html

# Brainstorming visual-companion scratch (mockups, server state)
.superpowers/
